uv is a modern, extremely fast Python package and project manager.

It is developed by Astral and written in Rust.

It provides a unified command-line interface for many common Python development tasks.

3.2 What Can uv Replace?

uv provides functionality that overlaps with several traditional Python tools.

Traditional Tool       | Purpose
